  <data name="Home_AlwaysFree" xml:space="preserve"><value>Always Free</value></data>
  <data name="Home_AlwaysFree_Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>No booking fees, no commissions, no hidden costs. The platform is completely free for both drivers and passengers.</value></data>
