  <data name="Home_NonProfit_Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>GoCheaper is run for the community, not for profit. No investors, no ads — just people helping people travel affordably.</value></data>
  <data name="Home_PayAfter" xml:space="preserve"><value>Pay After the Ride</value></data>
  <data name="Home_PayAfter_Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>No platform fees, no middleman. The driver sets the price upfront — you pay them directly when you arrive: cash, MobilePay (DK), Vipps (NO), or Swish (SE).</value></data>
