  <data name="Home_OpenSource_Desc1" xml:space="preserve"><value>GoCheaper is a non-profit project built with .NET 10 and a passion for sustainable, affordable travel. There are no shareholders — only contributors who believe that getting around shouldn't cost a fortune.</value></data>
